window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-014-fb7e2b978b34a1a9.json"]={sha256:"fb7e2b978b34a1a9367e0c406c96dd4cb249e746ed899cf73c39a2190ecb4465",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-e28608fb71a795c2","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446.html","title":"RFC 8446: TLS 1.3","titleEn":"RFC 8446: TLS 1.3","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-014","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-014","related":[{"id":"security-v27-015","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9147.html"],"title":"DTLS 1.3：亂序容忍與重複紀錄視窗","titleEn":"DTLS 1.3: reordering tolerance and duplicate-record windows","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：60%與45%均由逐列集合得到；寫入負例延後至完整握手，沒有宣稱0-RTT天然防重播。 交付early-data.csv、雙次轉移差異及路由審查紀錄；所有識別、帳戶與金額均為不可外用假資料。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Derive 60 and 45 percent from the row-level sets. State-changing counterexamples wait for a full handshake, and the report makes no claim that early data inherently prevents replay. Deliver early-data.csv, repeated-transition differences and route-review notes. All identities, accounts and amounts are inert fixtures with no external operational meaning.","difference":"以epoch、序號及已見位元建立接收狀態；準備新紀錄、視窗內未見亂序、已見重複與太舊紀錄四類，所有封包僅為離線整數描述。","differenceEn":"Model receiver state with epoch, sequence number and seen bits. Prepare fresh records, unseen in-window reordering, seen duplicates and too-old records, represented solely as offline integers rather than captured or injected network traffic.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課採保守規則：只有已確認無狀態變更且可容忍重播的操作能使用早期資料；不合格者延後至握手完成，不等於永久拒絕業務請求。 20種操作中12種通過語意審查；另8種包含計數器、狀態寫入或一次性動作，均從早期資料集合排除。 可准入比例12/20×100=60%；重新確認其中3種其實會寫入後，只餘9種，比例45%。","本課寬度W的含端點視窗為[H−W+1,H]；已見重複拒絕，未見且在窗內可接受。驗證標記只能在記錄認證成功後更新。 最高已認證序號H=1040，寬度W=64，兩個epoch分開維護；低界只是容量計算，不直接表示某筆紀錄一定未見。 最低窗內序號1040−64+1=977；擴窗至128後為913。接受與否仍依認證、epoch及重複位元，不能只比較數字。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["The local conservative rule admits early data only for operations confirmed to be replay-tolerant and free of state changes. Others wait until handshake completion; delaying early execution does not permanently deny the underlying business operation. Of 20 operation types, 12 pass the semantic review. Eight involve counters, writes or one-time actions and are excluded from early execution. Counts describe operation types, not observed traffic frequency or latency savings. Eligible proportion is 12/20×100=60 percent. Discovering hidden writes in three previously accepted types leaves nine, or 45 percent. The denominator stays fixed because no route was added or removed.","The selected inclusive window is [H−W+1,H] for width W and highest authenticated sequence H. Reject seen duplicates and allow unseen in-window records. Update seen state only after record authentication succeeds, preventing unauthenticated metadata from advancing the model. Set highest authenticated sequence H to 1040 and width W to 64. Maintain independent state for two epochs. The lower bound describes capacity, not whether a particular record has already been accepted. The lowest in-window sequence is 1040−64+1=977. Expanding to 128 moves it to 913. Admission still depends on authentication, epoch and the duplicate bit; a numerical bound alone is insufficient.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-024","referenceUrls":["https://openfga.dev/docs/modeling/parent-child","https://openfga.dev/docs/modeling/blocklists"],"title":"OpenFGA：父子繼承、交集與封鎖集合","titleEn":"OpenFGA: parent inheritance, intersections and blocked users","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：60%與45%均由逐列集合得到；寫入負例延後至完整握手，沒有宣稱0-RTT天然防重播。 交付early-data.csv、雙次轉移差異及路由審查紀錄；所有識別、帳戶與金額均為不可外用假資料。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Derive 60 and 45 percent from the row-level sets. State-changing counterexamples wait for a full handshake, and the report makes no claim that early data inherently prevents replay. Deliver early-data.csv, repeated-transition differences and route-review notes. All identities, accounts and amounts are inert fixtures with no external operational meaning.","difference":"建立10名合成使用者、兩個資料夾與文件的tuple清單；標記直接讀者、父層讀者及封鎖者，對每個判定保存最短證明路徑。","differenceEn":"Build tuples for ten synthetic users, two folders and a document. Mark direct readers, parent readers and blocked users, retaining a minimal proof path for each decision rather than reporting only aggregate counts.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課採保守規則：只有已確認無狀態變更且可容忍重播的操作能使用早期資料；不合格者延後至握手完成，不等於永久拒絕業務請求。 20種操作中12種通過語意審查；另8種包含計數器、狀態寫入或一次性動作，均從早期資料集合排除。 可准入比例12/20×100=60%；重新確認其中3種其實會寫入後，只餘9種，比例45%。","本地模型將直接與繼承讀者取聯集，再扣除封鎖集合；同一使用者有兩條路徑仍只計一次。規則必須以選定模型ID固定，避免測試途中換模型。 讀者聯集共8人，其中2人被封鎖；總使用者10人，另2人沒有任何讀取路徑。 有效讀者(8−2)/10×100=60%；另封鎖一名原本有效讀者後為(8−3)/10×100=50%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["The local conservative rule admits early data only for operations confirmed to be replay-tolerant and free of state changes. Others wait until handshake completion; delaying early execution does not permanently deny the underlying business operation. Of 20 operation types, 12 pass the semantic review. Eight involve counters, writes or one-time actions and are excluded from early execution. Counts describe operation types, not observed traffic frequency or latency savings. Eligible proportion is 12/20×100=60 percent. Discovering hidden writes in three previously accepted types leaves nine, or 45 percent. The denominator stays fixed because no route was added or removed.","The local model unions direct and inherited readers, then subtracts blocked users. Count a user once even when two paths grant access. Pin the authorization model ID so a changed model cannot silently alter the interpretation during evaluation. The reader union contains eight users, two of whom are blocked. Ten users form the fixed population; the other two have no read path. Explicitly list overlaps between direct and inherited grants to avoid double counting. Effective readership is (8−2)/10×100=60 percent. Blocking one additional previously eligible reader gives (8−3)/10×100=50 percent, while the inherited and direct grant sets remain unchanged.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-b1483a94465373cc","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9147.html","title":"RFC 9147: Datagram Transport Layer Security 1.3","titleEn":"RFC 9147: Datagram Transport Layer Security 1.3","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-ffaa4c5ed4171d66","url":"https://openfga.dev/docs/modeling/parent-child","title":"OpenFGA parent-child authorization modeling","titleEn":"OpenFGA parent-child authorization modeling","publisher":"OpenFGA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-f0e4f6b787ddb81f","url":"https://openfga.dev/docs/modeling/blocklists","title":"OpenFGA blocklists","titleEn":"OpenFGA blocklists","publisher":"OpenFGA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
